# Java service discipline

Match existing package layout, build tool, and dependency versions. Do not
upgrade the JDK or rewrite the build in-task.

Use parameterized queries or the project's ORM. Never concatenate untrusted
input into SQL.

Do not call `e.printStackTrace()` in new code. Use the project's logger and
existing exception mapping.

Reuse established HTTP, validation, and auth libraries. Do not add a second
web framework.
